	"data": "Story System — Subtitles, Spatial Audio, and Immersive Narrative\n\nOverview\n\nThe story system is the narrative layer of the larger Designing Reality / Cybernautics vision. It encompasses subtitle/caption display, speech recognition interaction, spatial audio storytelling, and the Calcifer-as-DM interaction model. This note consolidates Chris's original design work (2019–2020 journals) with later spatial audio explorations (2026) and the Ready Player One vision references.\n\nThe Subtitle…",
